{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15213480","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15213480","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1521348001:0":{"text":"마르코에 대해 들으신 게 있나요? 마르코... 잘 지내죠?","source_cn":"你们打听到马尔科的消息了吗？他……他还好吗？<key:...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6F9C58F06E2E783F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1521348002:0":{"text":"전쟁터에서 부상을 입고 군영에서 치료를 받고 있어요.","source_cn":"他在战场上受了伤，现在还在军营里接受治疗。<key:d...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEC648A3B7FA34A4D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1521348003:0":{"text":"대신 마르코가 당신에게 전하는 편지를 가져왔어요.","source_cn":"他写了一封信，托我们转交给你。<key:dialog1>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF1BA41707FE76433","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1521348004:0":{"text":"무사하면 다행이에요. 정말 다행이에요... 그럼 편지를 좀 볼게요.","source_cn":"没事就好，没事就好……我看看他的信。<key:dial...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x41FE80AB4D495BBA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1521348005:0":{"text":"푸는 마르코의 편지를 받아 들고 서둘러 읽기 시작했다.","source_cn":"芙接过马尔科写的信，连忙看了起来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9451842F810CFBBE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"",