ale":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1521348010:0":{"text":"당연하죠! 당연히 가야죠!","source_cn":"当然，我当然会去！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x3B23637D35D84B0D","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"당연하죠! 당연히 가야죠!","female":"당연하죠! 당연히 가야죠!","variant_male_record_index":"183552","variant_female_record_index":"183553","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1521348011:0":{"text":"며칠 뒤면 마르코를 만날 수 있다고 생각하니...","source_cn":"一想到再过几天就可以见到他，我简直……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF216E4D03510CDDE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1521348012:0":{"text":"...안 돼, 누나. 가면 안 돼!","source_cn":"——不行！姐姐你不能去！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0F88A354B000F3F1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1521348013:0":{"text":"트위스트이어? 어디서 나타난 거야?","source_cn":"扭耳？！你……你从哪冒出来的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF539952C26CC3DFF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1521348014:0":{"text":"안 알려 줘! 어쨌든 그 못된 보칼리스인이랑 만나면 안 돼!","source_cn":"我才不告诉你！反正你不要想和那个坏呼临人见面！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBF8E124ED8465749","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1521348015:1":{"text":"당장 부모님께 알려서 누나를 막아달라고 할 거야!","source_cn":"我现在就去告诉阿爹阿娘！让他们阻止你！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1FFE575D76B59E38","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1521348016:1":{"text":"트위스트이어, 트위스트이어!","source_cn":"扭耳——扭耳！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBC9D966AD92906D4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1521348017:0":{"text":"부모님이 이 사실을 알게 되면... 못 가게 될 수도 있어요.","source_cn":"如果他真的告诉你阿爹阿娘，你可能没办法去。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA5B79E0B5A22AFCB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1521348018:0":{"text":"알아요...","source_cn":"我知道……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x04451DF46D8852E0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1521348019:0":{"text":"하지만 전 갈 거예요.","source_cn":"但我一定要去。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D8A8B45D112392B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1521348020:0":{"text":"마르코가 저를 위해 용기를 냈으니... 그 마음을 저버릴 수